# Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth: "Each land is a Forest in addition to its other land types."
#
# Only lands on the battlefield (rulings 2021-06-18): a land card in the library is no Forest card while Yavimaya is
# out, and neither is a second Yavimaya there. Misty Rainforest, a Forest itself while on the battlefield, searches for
# "a Forest or Island card": the Island is there to be found, the Plains and the other Yavimaya are not.

[Bot1 Deck]
Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth
Misty Rainforest
Plains x5
Plains
Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth
Island
Plains x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Misty Rainforest.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Misty Rainforest.Subtypes = Forest
Bot1.Battlefield.Misty Rainforest.Activate(Ability: Search)
! Bot1.Search(Plains; Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth)
Bot1.Search(Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth; Island
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Subtypes = Forest; Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Misty Rainforest
Bot1.Library.Count = 6
Bot1.Life = 19
